    "answer": {
      "short": "$13\\,717$ Fizzoes",
      "worked": "Each box contains $11\\times43=473$ Fizzoes.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}473\\times29&=473\\times20+473\\times9\\\\473\\times29&=9460+4257\\\\473\\times29&=13\\,717\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere are $13\\,717$ Fizzoes in each carton.",
